fa922c0c9906dbe48ace0d5989493","commit_subject":"consensus: tolerate honest clock skew in block timestamps (fixes spurious \"Block preparation failed: Invalid block timestamp\" with no attacker anywhere). The rule was ZERO-tolerance (reject any stamp even 1 s ahead of the local clock) while production deliberately stamps max(now, parent_ts) — so one producer with a slightly fast clock poisoned the tip, the monotonic clamp propagated its stamp to every following HONEST producer, and any validator whose clock ran behind kept rejecting fresh honest blocks.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"israel-dryer/ttkbootstrap","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-12T04:10:46Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"9ce1df3e9144e0fd46d7989b1e6678fbc0c6ee2b","github_link":"https://github.com/israel-dryer/ttkbootstrap/commit/9ce1df3e9144e0fd46d7989b1e6678fbc0c6ee2b","commit_subject":"docs: Widgets catalog — the Choice family (Checkbutton/Radiobutton)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"cabloy/cabloy","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-12T04:10:37Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1416a212f2b02cda611da07b66d6fca3cfd5f752","github_link":"https://github.com/cabloy/cabloy/commit/1416a212f2b02cda611da07b66d6fca3cfd5f752","commit_subject":"fix: refresh stale media auth tokens","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"tony19/logback-android","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-12T04:09:25Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"a77dd3b6aaeaa54fc31125545b9a841decb8bb57","github_link":"https://github.com/tony19/logback-android/commit/a77dd3b6aaeaa54fc31125545b9a841decb8bb57","commit_subject":"fix: create app-specific external dirs via platform when mkdirs fails (#435)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"forcedotcom/salesforcedx-vscode","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-12T04:08:18Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"4bb060bec995fee53e6b1729d2fe3e771b709293","github_link":"https://github.com/forcedotcom/salesforcedx-vscode/commit/4bb060bec995fee53e6b1729d2fe3e771b709293","commit_subject":"refactor(apex): migrate telemetry to Effect spans, drop cor